          "Eligible participants collectively determine the favorite through ballots.",
          "Selection Circle verifies; it does not substitute its preference.",
          null,
          "Cycle / Voting Window",
          "Set before ballots open",
          "No retroactive extension to favor a horse",
          null
        ],
        [
          "Ballot Weight",
          "One eligible participant = one ballot.",
          "No weighted ballots based on age, role, donation, tenure, family, staff status or program performance.",
          null,
